    "summary": "As your opponent's [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) starts, you can pick 1 **PSYKER** model of yours that has this ability to use it. That model picks 1 enemy unit it can see within 12\", and you roll 1 D6:\n\n- 1: the **PSYKER** model takes D3 **[mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)**\n- 2–5: until the phase ends, attacks by models in the enemy unit get -1 to their **[Hit rolls](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls)**\n- 6: the enemy unit can't shoot this phase",
